# INT4 REFERENCE diag: same params as test_w2a16_diag but int4b_t, so the W2DBG cute-layout print for the
# KNOWN-GOOD int4 path can be compared line-by-line vs int2. Build: TARGET=test_w4a16_diag ./build.sh
